COMMENT ON COLUMN campaign.budget_allocation.project_budget_id IS 'Foreign key linking to project.project_budget. Business justification: Finance reconciliation in advertising agencies requires matching campaign media spend allocations against project budgets (which include labor, production, and media). This link enables the CFO-level LOGICAL REF -> work_mgmt_db.project.project_budget.project_budget_id (not enforced: cross-system).';
